WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:04,930
May I know what's going on now?

2
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:07,180
I don't have another Miko

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,180
Don’t blame Lu Lin

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,180
It's me who knows you're here

5
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,180
He just came here on his own initiative

6
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,180
I want to make peace with you

7
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,180
It has nothing to do with anyone else

8
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,180
you want to hate

9
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,180
Just hate me alone

10
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,180
Don't go out of the way Lin loses his temper on the road

11
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,180
I know you don't trust me now

12
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:23,180
But I really want to make peace with Miko

13
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,180
can you help me

14
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:27,560
Do you think she will meet you?

15
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,560
I admit

16
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:31,560
I've done a lot of things wrong before, but

17
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,560
I really care about her too much

18
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,560
can you give me some time

19
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,560
Let me apologize to her in person

20
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,560
if she forgives me

21
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,560
That means it's in her heart

22
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,560
I'm still the most important friend

23
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,560
if refused

24
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,560
Then I will give up too.

25
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:44,560
Why didn't Miko tell Song Jinyi?

26
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,560
She saved my life

27
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,560
Are you really afraid of Song Jinyi's appearance?

28
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,560
Will affect my gratitude to her

29
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,560
Let me help you meet Miko once

30
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:51,560
But if she is willing to reconcile with you

31
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,560
You have to be suspicious of Miko

32
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,560
Discussing her mother's personal affairs

33
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:56,560
apologize to her again

34
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:59,560
How can we reconcile with Miko after everything is like this?

35
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,560
I don't believe you're not angry

36
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:03,620
It's best to mention this harshly

37
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:07,620
Lu Ling will naturally have doubts about your personality.

38
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,620
i forgive you
